  "description": "The ULTRA GRIT is Ribble’s fastest gravel bike—developed and proven by our pro gravel team, the Ribble Outliers, in the chaos of the world’s toughest off-road races, from Unbound to The Traka to The Dirty Reiver. Weighing just 8.0 kg, this range-topping build is made for riders who thrive on the unknown. It pairs a lightweight, aerodynamic frameset with SRAM’s flagship RED XPLR AXS gravel groupset, featuring a built-in power meter, for pro-level training and race insight. Zipp 303 XPLR carbon wheels, versatile 45mm Schwalbe G-One R tyres, a 3D-printed Selle Italia Novus Boost saddle, and a carbon integrated cockpit complete this ultimate performance package. The Ribble ULTRA-GRIT is also available with the optional RockShox Rudy Ultimate suspension fork upgrade, delivering enhanced comfort, control, and confidence when the gravel turns rough and the trails get technical.",
